  "solution": "Given equation: 12 × 108 – 36 ÷ 6 + 18 = 48.\n\nBODMAS Table: \n\n [IMAGE: https://cdn.repeatermock.com/tb/d50192f098c21078501d30eeafe1a8c64bc30dd9621c48caa8a39ffc60f68b64.png] \n\nLet's check each option one by one.\n\nOption 1) - and +\n\nGiven: 12 × 108 – 36 ÷ 6 + 18 = 48\n\nAfter interchanging the numbers we get;\n\n⇒ 12 × 108 + __**36 ÷ 6**__ - 18 = 48\n\n⇒ __**12 × 108**__ + 6 - 18 = 48\n\n⇒ __**1296 + 6**__ - 18 = 48\n\n⇒ __1302 - 18__ = 48\n\n⇒ 1284 ≠ 48\n\n⇒ LHS ≠ RHS\n\nOption 2) **÷ and –**\n\nGiven: 12 × 108 – 36 ÷ 6 + 18 = 48\n\nAfter interchanging the numbers we get;\n\n⇒ 12 × __**108 ÷ 36**__ - 6 + 18 = 48\n\n⇒ __**12 × **__**__3__** - 6 + 18 = 48\n\n⇒ __36__ - 6 __**+ 18**__ = 48\n\n⇒ __**54 - 6**__ = 48\n\n⇒ 48 = 48\n\n⇒ LHS = RHS\n\nOption 3) + and ×\n\nGiven: 12 × 108 – 36 ÷ 6 + 18 = 48\n\nAfter interchanging the numbers we get;\n\n⇒ 12 + 108 – __**36 ÷ 6**__ × 18 = 48\n\n⇒ 12 + 108 – __6____** ×**____** 18**__ = 48\n\n⇒ __**12 + 108**__ – 108 = 48\n\n⇒ 120 - 108 = 48\n\n⇒ 12 ≠ 48\n\n⇒ LHS ≠ RHS\n\nOption 4) + and ÷\n\nGiven: 12 × 108 – 36 ÷ 6 + 18 = 48\n\nAfter interchanging the numbers we get;\n\n⇒ 12 × 108 – 36 + __**6 ÷ 18**__ = 48\n\n⇒ __**12 × 108**__ – 36 + 0.33 = 48\n\n⇒ __**1296**__ – 36 __**+ 0.33**__ = 48\n\n⇒ __1236.33____ - 36__ = 48\n\n⇒ 1200.33 ≠ 48\n\n⇒ LHS ≠ RHS\n\nHence, the correct answer is \"Option 2\".",
